      "content": "it's not exactly \"mild\" if it's constant, it's more like a heavy ache that won't go away. i don't really have a fever or anything though, just this weird localized feeling on the right. i'm pretty sure it's just something i ate. honestly the er is so expensive and i can barely afford to go right now unless it's like a total emergency. do you think it's safe to just take a couple of ibuprofen and wait until morning to see if it's gone?",
